From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: unom <packages@unom.io>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:21:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 38/38] punktfunk: stamp pfhdr35 on the 3.17.0 base

The stack moves to upstream 3.17.0. Upstream now aligns upload ring
allocations to the device's uniform offset limit, so the patch that
stamped pfhdr31 is gone. A new level lets a box tell the two bases
apart from its banner. No new capability.
---
 src/meson.build | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 72f2019a..518b6e65 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -227,7 +227,8 @@ vcs_tag = run_command(vcs_tag_cmd, check: false).stdout().strip()
 #   +pfhdr32 — …and a planar capture dmabuf on NVIDIA carries DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR's layout
 #   +pfhdr33 — …written into a storage buffer, so its bytes sit where the export says
 #   +pfhdr34 — …and a private reliable capture node beside the public one Steam reads
-version_tag = vcs_tag + '+pfhdr34' + ' (' + compiler_name + ' ' + compiler_version + ')'
+#   +pfhdr35 — …on upstream 3.17.0 (31 is upstream there)
+version_tag = vcs_tag + '+pfhdr35' + ' (' + compiler_name + ' ' + compiler_version + ')'
 
 gamescope_version_conf = configuration_data()
 gamescope_version_conf.set('VCS_TAG', version_tag)
